:"Richard Kinzley","x":"The third item you see related to the tax benefit of a legal restructuring effectuated in Q1 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/06/black-hills-corp-bkh-q3-2018-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"BKH 2018 Q3","e":"bkh","d":"2018-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Linden Evans","x":"Having fewer jurisdiction entities reduces our risk, our complexity and the quantity of rate reviews, regulatory filings and other reporting requirements and it will also help us streamline corporate processes and provide a one-time tax benefit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/06/black-hills-corp-bkh-q3-2018-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"BKH 2018 Q4","e":"bkh","d":"2019-02-08","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David Emery","x":"…filed an electric resource plan in Wyoming; we filed for approval of innovative renewable energy tariffs in Wyoming and South Dakota, and block chain and data center tariffs in Wyoming and Colorado; and we made significant progress toward combining our multiple gas distribution utilities in…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/08/black-hills-bkh-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"BKH 2018 Q4","e":"bkh","d":"2019-02-08","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Lin Evans","x":"On December 17, we requested approval for our voluntary renewable energy tariffs in South Dakota and Wyoming, and I plan to provide additional details about this later in the presentation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/08/black-hills-bkh-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"BKH 2018 Q4","e":"bkh","d":"2019-02-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lin Evans","x":"Well, we'll cross that bridge when we get to it, but we do have cost-plus contracts at the mine for our remaining plants, and we would certainly rightsize the mine and operate it as efficiently as we could from that perspective going forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/08/black-hills-bkh-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"BKH 2019 Q1","e":"bkh","d":"2019-05-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Linden Evans","x":"We are in the midst of the regulatory approval process for these voluntary tariffs and we are also seeking approval to construct a $57 million, 40-megawatt Corriedale wind energy project to support this program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/black-hills-corp-bkh-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"BKH 2019 Q1","e":"bkh","d":"2019-05-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Linden Evans","x":"In September last year, we requested a new tariff to support the growth of blockchain in Wyoming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/black-hills-corp-bkh-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"BKH 2019 Q1","e":"bkh","d":"2019-05-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard W. Kinzley","x":"The second and larger item related to tax benefits of legal restructuring is completed in 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/black-hills-corp-bkh-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"BKH 2019 Q1","e":"bkh","d":"2019-05-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Linden Evans","x":"We increased our 2019 guidance primarily due to the benefit of weather in the first quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/black-hills-corp-bkh-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"BKH 2019 Q2","e":"bkh","d":"2019-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Linden Evans","x":"These relatively poor conditions combined with trade tariffs that impact farmers and ranchers within our territories dampened overall economic activity in our Midwest service territory beyond what is otherwise measurable in degree days.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/black-hills-corp-bkh-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"BKH 2019 Q2","e":"bkh","d":"2019-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Linden Evans","x":"We are pleased that our South Dakota Electric and our Wyoming Electric Utilities received approval of the Renewable Ready Service Tariffs in the joint application for a CPCN to construct and operate the Corriedale Wind Energy Project.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/black-hills-corp-bkh-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"BKH 2019 Q3","e":"bkh","d":"2019-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Linden Evans","x":"Last Friday in response to the demand, we filed an amended renewable ready tariff with the South Dakota Public Utilities Commission to increase the capacity of the program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/06/black-hills-corp-bkh-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"BKH 2019 Q3","e":"bkh","d":"2019-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Linden Evans","x":"And so that's given us an opportunity to take advantage of some procedural rules with our South Dakota Commission to ask for an increase in tariff, which will allow us launch additional capital spending with respect to that project.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/06/black-hills-corp-bkh-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"BKH 2019 Q3","e":"bkh","d":"2019-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Linden Evans","x":"We also continue to make strides in several key regulatory initiatives, particularly on our jurisdiction consolidation efforts, which will help us streamline our business and our processes, while decreasing the number of go forward regulatory filings we required.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/06/black-hills-corp-bkh-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"BKH 2019 Q4","e":"bkh","d":"2020-02-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Linden Evans","x":"The approval allows for statewide customer rates and to consolidate general tariffs effective March 1 of 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/07/black-hills-corp-bkh-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"BKH 2019 Q4","e":"bkh","d":"2020-02-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Linden Evans","x":"We believe strongly in our plant in Colorado and will continue our efforts with the regulator to streamline our operations on behalf of our customers in that state.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/07/black-hills-corp-bkh-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"BKH 2019 Q4","e":"bkh","d":"2020-02-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Linden Evans","x":"It's going to really streamline both the Commission's efforts and our efforts in that state.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/07/black-hills-corp-bkh-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"BKH 2020 Q1","e":"bkh","d":"2020-05-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Linden Evans","x":"It also focuses on consolidating the two utilities into one single utility tariffs and rates just similar to what we have accomplished now in Wyoming and are trying to do in Colorado.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/black-hills-corp-bkh-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"BKH 2020 Q1","e":"bkh","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard Kinzley","x":"We've slowed our hiring and we are closely managing other expenses as we further leverage our cost saving continuous improvement program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/black-hills-corp-bkh-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"BKH 2020 Q1","e":"bkh","d":"2020-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Richard Kinzley","x":"Due to the mild first quarter weather combined with COVID-19 expectations for the remainder of the year, we reduced guidance by $0.10 on each end of the range.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/black-hills-corp-bkh-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"BKH 2020 Q4","e":"bkh","d":"2021-02-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Weinstein","x":"I'll pass it on to the next person now.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/black-hills-corp-bkh-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"BKH 2020 Q4","e":"bkh","d":"2021-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Linden Evans","x":"These approvals will help streamline our regulatory strategies in both states and provide efficiencies as we continuously improve how we serve and how we interact with our customers in those states.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/black-hills-corp-bkh-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"BKH 2020 Q4","e":"bkh","d":"2021-02-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Linden Evans","x":"We increased our 2021 guidance, we initiated 2022 guidance and we announced long-term earnings and dividend growth targets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/black-hills-corp-bkh-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"BKH 2020 Q4","e":"bkh","d":"2021-02-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Richard Kinzley","x":"We see opportunities to continue our strong cost management into 2021 and accordingly, increased our 2021 guidance to $3.80 to $4 per share, up $0.05 on each end [Phonetic].","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/black-hills-corp-bkh-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"BKH 2021 Q3","e":"bkh","d":"2021-11-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Linden Evans","x":"You may recall Wyoming was an early leader in passing legislation to support blockchain and crypto mining business and we already have an approved block chain interruptible service tariff in place.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/black-hills-corporation-bkh-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"BKH 2021 Q3","e":"bkh","d":"2021-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Linden Evans","x":"Finally, we demonstrated our discipline throughout the pandemic and after Winter Storm Uri to manage costs, and we're also fostering ongoing sustainable cost savings through innovation and continuous improvement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/black-hills-corporation-bkh-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"BKH 2021 Q3","e":"bkh","d":"2021-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Linden Evans","x":"We are gearing up a very formal program after two years of very aggressive cost cutting within this organization, kind of foisted on us because of the pandemic and then secondly, because of Uri.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/black-hills-corporation-bkh-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"BKH 2026 Q1","e":"bkh","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Marne M. Jones","x":"Meta’s new AI data center in Cheyenne is progressing, and we expect them to begin ramping later this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/black-hills-bkh-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BKH 2026 Q1","e":"bkh","d":"2026-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kimberly F. Nooney","x":"From a financial perspective, this complexity requires multiple negotiated agreements with earnings profiles designed to match the risks and considerations for each resource type under our Large Power Contract Service tariff in Wyoming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/black-hills-bkh-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BKH 2026 Q1","e":"bkh","d":"2026-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Marne M. Jones","x":"Our unique tariff offers flexibility in how we serve large load customers, enables speed to market, and provides customer protections while benefiting our Wyoming customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/black-hills-bkh-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BKH 2026 Q1","e":"bkh","d":"2026-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kimberly F. Nooney","x":"We reaffirmed our guidance range of $4.25 to $4.45 of adjusted EPS, which represents 6% growth at the midpoint over 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/black-hills-bkh-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BKH 2026 Q1","e":"bkh","d":"2026-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kimberly F. Nooney","x":"As you noted, we are reaffirming guidance, and we will continue to manage the business to ensure that we are focused on mitigating risks while achieving our financial objectives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/black-hills-bkh-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BKH 2026 Q2","e":"bkh","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Linden R. Evans","x":"Of more than 3 gigawatts of data center opportunities, only 600 megawatts is included in our current plan, driven by both Microsoft's ongoing expansion and Meta's new AI data center which is slated to begin ramping later this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/black-hills-bkh-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BKH 2026 Q2","e":"bkh","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Linden R. Evans","x":"Meta's AI data center in Cheyenne continues to progress as expected, we anticipate customer load beginning to ramp later this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/black-hills-bkh-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BKH 2026 Q2","e":"bkh","d":"2026-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Linden R. Evans","x":"The tariff is designed to directly recover transmission related investments and expenses from the large load customers benefiting from those facilities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/black-hills-bkh-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BKH 2026 Q2","e":"bkh","d":"2026-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Linden R. Evans","x":"We reaffirmed our guidance range of $4.25 to $4.45 of adjusted EPS which represents 6% growth at the midpoint over 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/black-hills-bkh-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BKH 2026 Q3","e":"bkh","d":"2026-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Linden Evans","x":"We included 600 megawatts of data center load in our current plan, driven largely by Microsoft's ongoing expansion and Meta's new AI data center, which we now expect to begin taking service in early 2027.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/black-hills-bkh-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BKH 2026 Q3","e":"bkh","d":"2026-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Linden Evans","x":"Leveraging our innovative Wyoming Large Power Contract Service, or LPCS, tariff, the agreements we executed with Google include our generation investment and our role in coordinating the delivery of energy from a total resource mix of 2.7 gigawatts to serve the project.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/black-hills-bkh-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BKH 2026 Q3","e":"bkh","d":"2026-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Linden Evans","x":"Again, driven by our unique large load LPCS tariff in Wyoming, our retail customers and shareholders benefit from our flexibility to serve large load customers with resources beyond traditional rate-based capital investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/black-hills-bkh-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BKH 2026 Q3","e":"bkh","d":"2026-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kimberly Nooney","x":"Our agreements with Google include contracted cost pass-through mechanisms, including debt costs, and allow us to begin earning a cash return on our generation investment during construction, which is expected to start in mid-2027.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/black-hills-bkh-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BKH 2026 Q3","e":"bkh","d":"2026-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kimberly Nooney","x":"Think about financing costs as a pass-through, so it would be net of financing costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/black-hills-bkh-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[35,1,8630,0,0,0,7397,817],[36,1,7507,0,0,0,6673,583],[37,1,6774,0,0,0,5348,1020],[38,1,5941,0,0,0,4939,592],[39,1,5910,0,0,0,4945,677],[40,1,5826,0,0,0,5149,372],[41,1,7406,0,0,0,6875,204],[42,1,8023,0,0,0,6945,750],[43,1,6046,0,0,0,5002,735],[44,1,5714,0,0,0,4512,863],[45,1,5298,0,0,0,4332,633],[46,1,4677,0,0,0,3990,398],[47,1,4961,0,0,0,4376,326],[65,1,5384,0,0,0,4356,736],[66,1,3852,0,0,0,265,3342],[67,1,5263,0,0,0,4724,352]],"cinema":[[35,1,8630,0,0,0,7397,817],[36,1,7507,0,0,0,6673,583],[37,1,6774,0,0,0,5348,1020],[38,1,5941,0,0,0,4939,592],[39,1,5910,0,0,0,4945,677],[40,1,5826,0,0,0,5149,372],[41,1,7406,0,0,0,6875,204],[42,1,8023,0,0,0,6945,750],[43,1,6046,0,0,0,5002,735],[44,1,5714,0,0,0,4512,863],[45,1,5298,0,0,0,4332,633],[46,1,4677,0,0,0,3990,398],[47,1,4961,0,0,0,4376,326],[65,1,5384,0,0,0,4356,736],[66,1,3852,0,0,0,265,3342],[67,1,5263,0,0,0,4724,352]],"imax":[[35,1,8630,0,0,0,7397,817],[36,1,7507,0,0,0,6673,583],[37,1,6774,0,0,0,5348,1020],[38,1,5941,0,0,0,4939,592],[39,1,5910,0,0,0,4945,677],[40,1,5826,0,0,0,5149,372],[41,1,7406,0,0,0,6875,204],[42,1,8023,0,0,0,6945,750],[43,1,6046,0,0,0,5002,735],[44,1,5714,0,0,0,4512,863],[45,1,5298,0,0,0,4332,633],[46,1,4677,0,0,0,3990,398],[47,1,4961,0,0,0,4376,326],[65,1,5384,0,0,0,4356,736],[66,1,3852,0,0,0,265,3342],[67,1,5263,0,0,0,4724,352]],"streaming":[[35,1,8630,0,0,0,7397,817],[36,1,7507,0,0,0,6673,583],[37,1,6774,0,0,0,5348,1020],[38,1,5941,0,0,0,4939,592],[39,1,5910,0,0,0,4945,677],[40,1,5826,0,0,0,5149,372],[41,1,7406,0,0,0,6875,204],[42,1,8023,0,0,0,6945,750],[43,1,6046,0,0,0,5002,735],[44,1,5714,0,0,0,4512,863],[45,1,5298,0,0,0,4332,633],[46,1,4677,0,0,0,3990,398],[47,1,4961,0,0,0,4376,326],[65,1,5384,0,0,